from common import U,Q,S,T
UNITS=[
U('C201','Nuansa, implikasi, dan ambiguitas','Menafsirkan lebih dari satu kemungkinan makna tanpa menganggap implikasi sebagai fakta.',
'Scope ambiguity|Implicature|Aspect and attitude|Presupposition|Qualification|Context-sensitive interpretation',
'Not all members agreed berarti tidak semua setuju; tidak sama dengan No members agreed. Only Maya checked the draft membatasi pelaku, sedangkan Maya checked only the draft membatasi objek. Pada tingkat lanjut, posisi kecil bisa mengubah cakupan klaim secara besar.||Makna pragmatis bergantung konteks. The room is a little warm dapat menjadi komentar suhu atau permintaan membuka jendela. I was hoping you could help melunakkan permintaan sekarang, bukan selalu melaporkan harapan yang berakhir. Bedakan isi literal, implikasi yang masuk akal, dan hal yang belum bisa dipastikan. Jika keputusan bergantung pada makna, klarifikasi lebih baik daripada menebak.',
[('not all ≠ none','Not all reviewers agreed.','Sebagian tidak setuju; jumlah pasti belum diketahui.'),('only + focused constituent','Only Maya checked the draft.','Pembatasan pelaku.'),('I was hoping + clause','I was hoping you could review this.','Past progressive dapat melunakkan permintaan kini.')],
('Not all reviewers agreed. → No reviewer agreed.','Not all reviewers agreed. → At least one reviewer did not agree.','Penolakan universal berbeda dari tidak adanya persetujuan universal.'),
'At the end of a meeting, the chair said, “Not all reviewers were convinced, and we have yet to establish whether the result will hold outside the pilot.” A colleague replied, “That is a rather ambitious conclusion.” Depending on tone and context, the reply might praise the scope or cautiously question the claim. The minutes should record the unresolved issue rather than silently converting either remark into unanimous approval or rejection.',
'implication=implikasi|scope=cakupan makna|presupposition=anggapan yang tersirat|unanimous=bulat tanpa perbedaan|qualification=pembatasan klaim|literal=harfiah',
[Q('Not all reviewers were convinced memastikan …','at least one reviewer was not convinced','every reviewer rejected it||exactly half rejected it','Not all tidak menentukan jumlah tepat.','meaning'),Q('Only Maya checked the draft menyorot …','siapa yang memeriksa','dokumen satu-satunya yang diperiksa Maya||kapan pemeriksaan selesai','Only mendahului fokus pelaku.','meaning'),Q('Apakah rather ambitious pasti pujian?','Tidak; nada dan konteks dapat mengubah implikasinya.','Ya, selalu.||Tidak, selalu hinaan.','Pragmatik tidak dapat ditentukan satu frasa tanpa konteks.','pragmatics'),Q('We have yet to establish whether … berarti …','the matter has not been established so far','the matter was conclusively proven||no one will ever investigate','Yet mempertahankan status belum selesai.','meaning'),Q('Catatan rapat paling akurat …','The applicability beyond the pilot remains unresolved.','The reviewers unanimously approved expansion.||Every reviewer rejected all findings.','Rangkuman harus mempertahankan status belum pasti.','reading'),S('Isi satu kata: Not ___ reviewers agreed; at least one remained unconvinced.','all','Not all menolak generalisasi universal.')],
[T('speaking','Tafsirkan dua kemungkinan makna That is an ambitious proposal, lalu ajukan klarifikasi yang netral.','You may mean that the proposal has valuable scope, or that it exceeds the available resources. Could you clarify which aspect concerns you?','Dua tafsir masuk akal|Tidak mengklaim tahu niat|Klarifikasi netral'),T('writing','Tulis catatan rapat empat kalimat yang mempertahankan batas keputusan.','Some reviewers remained unconvinced. The applicability of the result beyond the pilot has not yet been established. A colleague questioned or commented on the ambition of the conclusion, but the intended emphasis was not clarified. No unanimous decision should be inferred from these remarks.','Literal/implikasi dibedakan|Tidak menambahkan keputusan|Bahasa presisi')],'nuance',('C108',)),
U('C202','Satu informasi, tiga audiens','Mengubah genre dan register tanpa mengubah fakta, tingkat kepastian, atau tindakan.',
'Audience design|Genre conventions|Technical-to-public mediation|Executive briefing|Plain language|Information hierarchy',
'Adaptasi audiens bukan menyederhanakan sampai makna hilang. Pakar mungkin membutuhkan metode dan ketidakpastian statistik; pengguna membutuhkan dampak dan tindakan. Kedua versi harus mempertahankan fakta dasar serta batas bukti yang sama. Kata teknis boleh dijelaskan dengan contoh konkret, bukan dihapus bila menjadi inti keputusan.||Urutkan informasi berdasarkan kebutuhan genre. Laporan insiden biasanya membedakan timeline, dampak, penyebab yang terkonfirmasi, dugaan, dan langkah lanjut. Pemberitahuan pengguna mendahulukan apa yang terdampak serta apa yang harus dilakukan. Ringkasan pimpinan mendahulukan keputusan, risiko, dan sumber daya. Jangan mengubah not yet confirmed menjadi confirmed demi kalimat singkat.',
[('technical term + plain explanation','Latency, or the delay before a response, increased.','Jelaskan istilah tanpa kehilangan makna.'),('impact → action → update','Some uploads failed. Please retry. We will update you at noon.','Urutan pemberitahuan.'),('decision → rationale → uncertainty','Approve a limited trial; demand is promising but unconfirmed.','Urutan briefing keputusan.')],
('No data was lost. (ketika pemeriksaan belum selesai)','We have not found evidence of data loss so far; checks are continuing.','Tidak menemukan bukti sementara bukan jaminan mutlak.'),
'Fictional incident brief: Between 09:10 and 09:25, some file uploads failed. Reading existing files was unaffected. The service team restored uploads at 09:25. Log analysis is continuing, and the cause has not been confirmed. Users whose uploads failed should retry once. The team will issue another update at noon, even if the investigation is still ongoing.',
'latency=jeda respons|restore=memulihkan|ongoing=masih berlangsung|briefing=penjelasan ringkas|unaffected=tidak terdampak|hierarchy=urutan kepentingan',
[Q('Informasi terpenting untuk pengguna terdampak …','Retry failed uploads once; reading existing files was unaffected.','The cause is definitely known.||Every file was deleted.','Tindakan dan dampak sesuai brief.','reading'),Q('Pernyataan yang melampaui bukti …','The outage was caused by a database failure.','The cause remains unconfirmed.||Uploads were restored at 09:25.','Tidak ada penyebab terkonfirmasi.','reasoning'),Q('Versi sederhana latency yang akurat …','the delay before a response','the permanent loss of a file||the price of a subscription','Penjelasan mempertahankan konsep.','vocabulary'),Q('Mengapa update tetap diberikan pukul dua belas?','To communicate progress even if the cause remains uncertain.','Because every investigation must finish by noon.||To announce a known cause regardless of evidence.','Jadwal komunikasi bukan tenggat kepastian.','reading'),Q('Ringkasan yang mempertahankan scope …','Some uploads failed for fifteen minutes.','The whole service was unavailable all day.||Only one user ever had a problem.','Some tidak diperluas menjadi seluruh layanan.','editing'),S('Lengkapi: The cause has not yet ___ confirmed.','been','Present perfect passive: has been + V3.')],
[T('speaking','Jelaskan insiden kepada pengguna awam dalam 45 detik, lalu kepada manajer dalam 45 detik.','For users: Some uploads failed between 09:10 and 09:25. Please retry a failed upload once. Existing files remained readable. For the manager: Uploads have been restored; the cause is still under investigation, and a further update is due at noon.','Fakta sama di kedua versi|Prioritas sesuai audiens|Tidak menjanjikan hasil investigasi'),T('writing','Buat tiga versi masing-masing 35–55 kata: notifikasi pengguna, briefing manajer, dan catatan teknis.','User notice: Some file uploads failed between 09:10 and 09:25. Uploads are now working again, and existing files remained readable throughout. If your upload failed, please retry once. We are still investigating the cause and will provide another update at noon.\n\nManager briefing: The upload interruption lasted from 09:10 to 09:25 and affected some uploads only. Reading existing files remained available. Uploads have been restored, but the cause is not yet confirmed. The team is continuing its investigation and has committed to a noon update.\n\nTechnical note: Upload failures were reported during the 09:10–09:25 interval. Read access to existing files was unaffected. Upload functionality was restored at 09:25. Log analysis remains in progress; no root cause has been confirmed. A further status update is scheduled for noon.','Tiga genre|35–55 kata per versi|Tidak menambah fakta teknis')],'register',('C201',)),
U('C203','Idiom, ironi, dan retorika','Memahami ungkapan figuratif dan memilih kapan bahasa langsung lebih tepat.',
'Idiomatic meaning|Irony and tone|Metaphor|Rhetorical contrast|Cultural variation|Inclusive communication',
'Idiom seperti on the same page berarti memiliki pemahaman yang sama, bukan berada pada halaman fisik. Ungkapan dapat membantu keakraban, tetapi tidak otomatis membuat bahasa lebih mahir. Dalam komunikasi lintas bahasa, align our understanding kadang lebih jelas. Jangan menerjemahkan idiom kata demi kata.||Ironi bergantung pada pertentangan antara ungkapan dan keadaan, serta isyarat nada. Great timing! ketika listrik mati sebelum presentasi mungkin ironi; dalam konteks lain itu pujian tulus. Teks tanpa isyarat tidak selalu memungkinkan kepastian. Retorika yang baik membantu gagasan; hindari metafora campur yang membingungkan atau humor yang merendahkan audiens.',
[('idiom → intended meaning','Let us get on the same page → agree on our understanding.','Tafsirkan sebagai satu kesatuan.'),('literal praise + contradictory context','Perfect timing, said during an interruption.','Kemungkinan ironi; periksa konteks.'),('parallel contrast','We need fewer promises and clearer commitments.','Struktur sejajar menajamkan perbandingan.')],
('Let us touch the base tomorrow. (idiom: menghubungi singkat)','Let us touch base tomorrow.','Idiom memiliki bentuk yang lazim; pada konteks internasional bisa gunakan Let us check in tomorrow.'),
'A project lead wrote, “Before we move the goalposts again, let us get on the same page about what completion means.” The team had changed the acceptance criteria twice. In a later message to new volunteers, the lead chose plainer wording: “Please confirm the completion criteria before we change them.” The second message retained the request while reducing reliance on idiomatic knowledge.',
'move the goalposts=mengubah kriteria setelah proses berjalan|on the same page=sepemahaman|touch base=menghubungi singkat|irony=ironi|literal=harfiah|criterion=kriteria',
[Q('Move the goalposts dalam konteks berarti …','change the criteria during the process','move sports equipment only||finish the project early','Konteks menyebut perubahan acceptance criteria.','reading'),Q('Get on the same page berarti …','establish a shared understanding','print every file||choose an identical book','Idiom menyatakan kesepahaman.','vocabulary'),Q('Mengapa versi kedua lebih cocok untuk relawan baru lintas bahasa?','It reduces dependence on idiomatic knowledge.','It removes the request entirely.||It is automatically more polite in every culture.','Kejelasan meningkat tanpa klaim universal kesantunan.','pragmatics'),Q('Great timing! pasti ironi?','No; the situation and tone matter.','Yes, always.||No, it can never be ironic.','Makna tidak universal tanpa konteks.','pragmatics'),Q('Alternatif langsung touch base …','check in briefly','touch the physical floor||rewrite the entire contract','Makna menghubungi singkat.','vocabulary'),S('Lengkapi idiom: Let us get on the same ___.','page','Ungkapan ini bermakna menyamakan pemahaman.')],
[T('speaking','Jelaskan satu idiom kepada pembelajar baru, berikan konteks cocok dan versi langsungnya.','Move the goalposts means changing the criteria after work has begun. It may be useful in an informal team discussion, but for a new international colleague I would say, Please avoid changing the acceptance criteria midway through the project.','Makna figuratif benar|Konteks jelas|Alternatif mudah dipahami'),T('writing','Tulis ulang pesan project lead untuk dua audiens: tim akrab dan relawan baru.','Established team: Before we move the goalposts again, can we get on the same page about what done means?\nNew volunteers: Please confirm the completion criteria before making further changes. We need a shared definition so that everyone can plan their work consistently.','Maksud tetap|Pilihan register beralasan|Tidak memakai idiom berlebihan')],'register',('C202',)),
U('C204','Menyunting makna hingga presisi','Memperbaiki ambiguity, parallelism, modifier, dan punctuation tanpa menghapus suara penulis.',
'Modifier attachment|Parallel structure|Restrictive punctuation|Scope of negation|Reference clarity|Editorial judgement',
'Sunting makna terlebih dahulu, lalu struktur, kemudian permukaan. Walking into the room, the chart looked confusing seolah chart yang berjalan; perbaiki subjek klausa utama atau ubah pembuka. The committee discussed hiring a tutor, new materials, and to extend hours tidak sejajar; pilih semua nomina atau semua bentuk -ing.||Tanda baca juga memengaruhi cakupan. The students who submitted drafts received feedback membatasi kelompok; The students, who submitted drafts, received feedback menambahkan informasi tentang kelompok siswa yang telah diketahui. Jangan menghapus koma hanya demi panjang kalimat. Ketika maksud penulis tidak dapat dipastikan, beri pertanyaan editorial, bukan memperbaiki dengan tebakan.',
[('participial opener → same understood subject','Reviewing the chart, Maya noticed an error.','Subjek pelaku harus cocok.'),('parallel items','hiring staff, buying books, and extending hours','Bentuk daftar sejajar.'),('defining vs supplementary clause','Members who registered / members, who registered, …','Koma dapat mengubah cakupan.')],
('After reviewing the figures, the error became obvious.','After reviewing the figures, Maya noticed the error.','Versi revisi membuat pelaku reviewing eksplisit.'),
'An editor receives this draft: “After examining the results, the recommendation was revised. The plan aims to reduce queues, improving access, and greater reliability. Members who registered before Friday will receive a reminder.” The editor knows that Maya examined the results but does not know whether every member registered before Friday. The first two sentences can be clarified; the third should not be broadened to all members without checking.',
'modifier=unsur penerang|attachment=hubungan unsur penerang|parallelism=kesejajaran|restrictive=membatasi rujukan|ambiguity=ketaksaan|editorial query=pertanyaan penyunting',
[Q('Revisi dengan pelaku benar …','After examining the results, Maya revised the recommendation.','After examining the results, the recommendation examined itself.||After examined, Maya recommendation.','Maya melakukan examining dan revising.','editing'),Q('Daftar sejajar …','reduce queues, improve access, and increase reliability','reduce queues, improving access, and greater reliability||reduction, improve, and reliably','Tiga verba base form setelah aims to.','editing'),Q('Members who registered before Friday merujuk …','the subset meeting the registration condition','necessarily every member||only people who never registered','Defining relative membatasi kelompok.','meaning'),Q('Apakah koma boleh ditambahkan untuk menyatakan semua anggota?','Only after checking that this is the intended meaning.','Always, because commas are decorative.||Never in any English sentence.','Penyunting tidak boleh memperluas fakta tanpa dasar.','editing'),Q('Urutan penyuntingan yang masuk akal …','meaning, structure, then surface details','punctuation alone regardless of meaning||replace all words with longer synonyms','Perbaikan bentuk harus menjaga maksud.','reasoning'),S('Sejajarkan: The plan aims to reduce queues, ___ access, and increase reliability. (improve)','improve','Infinitive to menaungi tiga base verbs.')],
[T('speaking','Jelaskan kepada penulis dua revisi dan satu hal yang perlu diklarifikasi tanpa menyalahkannya.','I named Maya so that the opening phrase has a clear subject. I also made the three aims parallel. Before changing the final sentence, could you confirm whether all members registered before Friday or only some did?','Alasan spesifik|Nada kolaboratif|Ketidakpastian ditanyakan'),T('writing','Sunting draft pada bacaan dan tambahkan satu editorial query.','After examining the results, Maya revised the recommendation. The plan aims to reduce queues, improve access, and increase reliability. Members who registered before Friday will receive a reminder.\nEditorial query: Does the final sentence intentionally refer only to members who registered before Friday? I have retained that restriction pending clarification.','Dangling modifier diperbaiki|Daftar sejajar|Cakupan relatif dipertahankan')],'clarity',('C203',)),
U('C205','Memediasi diskusi yang rumit','Merangkum posisi berbeda, membedakan kesepakatan dari ketegangan, dan mengundang klarifikasi.',
'Active listening|Mediation|Turn management|Reframing|Agreement tracking|Clarification',
'Mediasi bahasa membantu orang memahami satu sama lain. Ringkasan yang adil tidak harus membuat semua pihak tampak setuju. Pisahkan posisi, alasan, dan batas yang tidak dapat dinegosiasikan. So you support the goal but question the timing? dapat memeriksa pemahaman tanpa menambahkan niat.||Dalam diskusi cepat, gunakan penanda giliran dan rangkuman sementara: Before we move on, may I check…; We agree on the objective, but not yet on… . Latihan berbasis transkrip di sini menguji pembacaan dan strategi mediasi. Kemampuan mendengar percakapan spontan harus dinilai lagi melalui audio atau percakapan nyata dengan tempo dan aksen yang beragam, bukan diasumsikan dari keberhasilan membaca.',
[('If I understand correctly, …','If I understand correctly, you support the goal but need more time.','Verifikasi pemahaman.'),('We agree on …, but … remains unresolved','We agree on access; the funding remains unresolved.','Petakan status kesepakatan.'),('Could you clarify whether …?','Could you clarify whether the limit is time or cost?','Pisahkan kemungkinan hambatan.')],
('Everyone agreed to launch next week. (satu pihak masih keberatan)','The group supports the goal, but the launch date remains disputed.','Ringkasan mediasi tidak boleh menghapus keberatan.'),
'Rina: I support evening classes, but next week is too soon to arrange childcare. Omar: Waiting another month could mean losing the available tutor. Jo: Could we run one optional introductory session next week and start the full programme later? Rina: I could support that if missing the introduction does not disadvantage anyone. Omar: I need to check whether the tutor would accept that arrangement. No final schedule is agreed.',
'mediate=memediasi|constraint=batasan|disadvantage=merugikan|introductory=pengenalan|provisional=sementara|unresolved=belum terselesaikan',
[Q('Kesamaan Rina dan Omar …','Both want the programme to be possible.','Both reject evening classes.||Both have confirmed next week.','Keberatan berhubungan dengan timing dan ketersediaan.','reading'),Q('Syarat Rina untuk sesi pengenalan …','Absence must not disadvantage participants.','Everyone must attend compulsorily.||The tutor must work without pay.','Syarat disebut eksplisit.','reading'),Q('Apa yang harus diperiksa Omar?','whether the tutor accepts the arrangement','whether Rina exists||whether the whole programme has ended','Belum ada konfirmasi tutor.','reading'),Q('Ringkasan netral …','An optional introduction is proposed, subject to access and tutor availability.','The schedule is final.||Rina refuses all compromise.','Pertahankan syarat dan status proposal.','mediation'),Q('Bukti listening dari soal transkrip ini …','Belum cukup; diperlukan tugas audio atau interaksi nyata.','Pasti setara penutur mahir.||Membaca tidak punya manfaat apa pun.','Tipe tugas menentukan klaim yang boleh dibuat.','assessment'),S('Lengkapi: The launch date ___ unresolved. (remain)','remains','Date tunggal memakai remains.')],
[T('speaking','Lakukan role-play tiga pihak. Rangkum setiap posisi, ajukan klarifikasi, dan catat keputusan sementara.','We share the goal of offering evening classes. The proposed introduction could address timing, provided absence has no disadvantage and the tutor agrees. Omar will check availability; until then, the schedule remains provisional.','Semua posisi adil|Syarat dipertahankan|Respons spontan pada klarifikasi'),T('writing','Tulis notulen yang memisahkan shared goal, proposal, conditions, dan next action.','Shared goal: Offer evening classes. Proposal: Run an optional introduction next week and begin the full programme later. Conditions: Missing the introduction must not disadvantage participants, and the tutor must accept the arrangement. Next action: Omar will check with the tutor. Status: No final schedule has been agreed.','Empat komponen jelas|Tidak menciptakan kesepakatan|Penanggung jawab tindakan')],'mediation',('C204',)),
U('C206','Merekonsiliasi sumber yang tampak bertentangan','Menguji definisi, waktu, denominator, dan metode sebelum menyimpulkan kontradiksi.',
'Comparability|Denominator|Definitions|Time windows|Triangulation|Uncertainty communication',
'Dua angka yang berbeda belum tentu bertentangan. Laporan A bisa menghitung pengguna terdaftar, sedangkan B menghitung pengguna aktif dalam sebulan. Selalu samakan definisi, satuan, rentang waktu, dan populasi sebelum membandingkan. Proporsi tanpa denominator sering menyesatkan: 80% dari lima orang tidak setara kekuatan informasinya dengan 80% dari lima ribu orang.||Rekonsiliasi bukan memaksa semua sumber sepakat. Setelah definisi disejajarkan, mungkin masih ada perbedaan yang tidak dapat dijelaskan. Nyatakan unresolved discrepancy dan minta data yang diperlukan. Dalam bahasa Inggris, apparently, whereas, on a comparable basis, dan cannot yet be reconciled membantu mempertahankan nuansa tersebut.',
[('A measures X, whereas B measures Y','A counts registrations, whereas B counts monthly activity.','Bedakan definisi.'),('on a comparable basis','The figures should be compared on a comparable basis.','Samakan dasar.'),('cannot yet be reconciled because …','The totals cannot yet be reconciled because records are missing.','Nyatakan batas informasi.')],
('The reports disagree: 500 registrations versus 120 active users.','The reports measure different things: total registrations and monthly activity.','Perbedaan ukuran bukan otomatis kontradiksi.'),
'Fictional Source A reports 500 registered accounts at the end of June. Source B records 120 accounts with at least one completed lesson during June. Source C states that 80% of twenty survey respondents were satisfied. None of the sources identifies whether the survey respondents were active learners. The figures can describe the same service without agreeing numerically, but they cannot establish the satisfaction rate of all 500 account holders.',
'denominator=penyebut/dasar pembagian|comparable=dapat dibandingkan|discrepancy=ketidaksesuaian|registered=terdaftar|reconcile=menyelaraskan|triangulate=membandingkan beberapa sumber',
[Q('A dan B pasti bertentangan?','No; registered and active accounts are different measures.','Yes; every registration must be active.||Yes; all reports must share one total.','Definisi berbeda.','reasoning'),Q('Berapa responden puas di C?','16','80||400','80% × 20 = 16.','data'),Q('Bolehkah mengatakan 400 dari 500 pengguna puas?','No; the survey does not establish that population rate.','Yes, by multiplying automatically.||Yes, because all surveys are representative.','Tidak ada dasar generalisasi sampel.','reasoning'),Q('Hubungan responden dengan pengguna aktif …','unknown from the supplied sources','all certainly active||all certainly inactive','Sumber tidak mengidentifikasi hubungan.','reading'),Q('Data lanjutan paling berguna …','sampling method and links between survey and activity populations','only the logo colour||a larger number with no definition','Untuk menilai representasi perlu metode dan populasi.','reasoning'),S('Lengkapi: Source A counts registrations, ___ Source B counts activity.','whereas||while','Whereas/while menandai perbedaan ukuran.')],
[T('speaking','Beri briefing dua menit kepada pengelola: jelaskan tiga ukuran dan larang satu kesimpulan yang keliru dengan alasan.','There were 500 registered accounts, of which 120 completed at least one lesson in June. Sixteen of twenty survey respondents were satisfied. We cannot infer satisfaction among all account holders because the sampling method and overlap with active learners are unknown.','Tiga angka tepat|Denominator jelas|Batas generalisasi'),T('writing','Tulis catatan rekonsiliasi 90–120 kata untuk laporan pengelola.','The three fictional sources describe different populations and should not be treated as contradictory totals. Source A counts 500 registered accounts at the end of June, while Source B identifies 120 accounts that completed at least one lesson during that month. Source C reports satisfaction among twenty survey respondents; its 80% figure corresponds to sixteen people. The supplied information does not establish whether those respondents were active learners or representative of all account holders. We can report the figures separately with their definitions, but we cannot infer that 400 of the 500 account holders were satisfied. The survey method should be reviewed before making that claim.','90–120 kata|Definisi/populasi terpisah|Kesimpulan sesuai bukti')],'evidence',('C205',)),
U('C207','Komunikasi sulit dan tanggung jawab','Menyampaikan masalah dengan empati, ketepatan, dan komitmen yang dapat dipenuhi.',
'Accountability|Known/unknown/action|Empathy without assumption|Calibrated commitment|Correction|Follow-up',
'Dalam situasi sulit, bahasa kabur merusak kepercayaan. Mistakes were made mungkin gramatikal, tetapi menghilangkan pelaku ketika tanggung jawab justru penting. We sent the wrong schedule menjelaskan tindakan; We apologise for the disruption mengakui dampak tanpa menebak perasaan semua orang.||Susun pesan menjadi apa yang diketahui, apa yang belum diketahui, apa yang sedang dilakukan, dan kapan kabar berikutnya diberikan. Bedakan komitmen tindakan yang dapat dikendalikan dari hasil yang belum pasti: We will update you by four lebih dapat dipertanggungjawabkan daripada Everything will be fixed by four jika penyebab belum ditemukan. Bila informasi sebelumnya keliru, koreksi eksplisit agar pembaca tidak harus membandingkan versi diam-diam.',
[('We did X; we apologise for Y','We sent an incorrect schedule; we apologise for the disruption.','Akui tindakan dan dampak.'),('We know …; we are still checking …','We know the date was wrong; we are checking who received it.','Pisahkan kepastian dan investigasi.'),('Correction: … replaces …','Correction: Monday replaces Tuesday in our earlier notice.','Koreksi terlihat.')],
('Everything will definitely be fixed by four. (hasil belum pasti)','We will provide an update by four, including any issues still unresolved.','Komitmen komunikasi dapat dipenuhi meski penyelesaian belum pasti.'),
'Fictional situation: A course team sent a notice listing Tuesday instead of Monday. The correct session date is Monday, 8 June, in this invented scenario. The team is checking which recipients opened the incorrect notice. It can send a correction immediately, but cannot yet confirm whether everyone has seen it. A further contact check will be reported by 16:00.',
'accountability=tanggung jawab|disruption=gangguan|recipient=penerima|correction=koreksi|commitment=komitmen|unresolved=belum selesai',
[Q('Fakta yang sudah pasti dalam skenario …','The notice listed the wrong day.','Every recipient has read the correction.||No one was inconvenienced.','Status penerimaan masih diperiksa.','reading'),Q('Komitmen yang didukung brief …','We will report the contact check by 16:00.','Everyone will certainly read it by 16:00.||No recipient will ever be confused.','Tim mengendalikan pelaporan, bukan semua perilaku penerima.','reasoning'),Q('Versi bertanggung jawab …','We sent an incorrect schedule.','Errors somehow happened by themselves.||Recipients should have guessed correctly.','Pelaku dan tindakan disebut.','register'),Q('Empati tanpa mengasumsikan perasaan semua orang …','We apologise for the disruption this may have caused.','We know every recipient is furious.||No one could possibly mind.','Akui kemungkinan dampak tanpa membaca pikiran.','pragmatics'),Q('Koreksi yang jelas …','Correction: the session is on Monday, not Tuesday.','Please see our new message and guess the change.||The old notice was nearly right.','Perubahan eksplisit mengurangi salah paham.','editing'),S('Lengkapi: We apologise ___ the incorrect notice.','for','Apologise for diikuti nomina atau gerund.')],
[T('speaking','Sampaikan koreksi selama satu menit lalu jawab pertanyaan: Apakah semua orang sudah tahu?','We sent the wrong day in our notice. The session is on Monday in this scenario, and we apologise for the disruption. We have issued a correction, but we cannot yet confirm that everyone has seen it. We will report the contact check by four.','Tanggung jawab jelas|Jawaban tidak defensif|Tidak menjamin penerimaan'),T('writing','Tulis pesan koreksi yang bisa dipahami tanpa membaca pesan lama.','Correction to our earlier course notice: the session is on Monday, 8 June, not Tuesday. We sent the incorrect day and apologise for the disruption this may have caused. Please use Monday when planning your attendance. We are checking that recipients have received the correction and will provide a further contact update by 16:00. We cannot yet confirm that everyone has seen the revised notice.','Mandiri tanpa pesan lama|Apa/aksi/update jelas|Fakta rekaan tidak menjadi pengumuman nyata')],'proposal',('C206',)),
U('C208','Portofolio: presisi, keluwesan, dan transfer','Menggabungkan analisis sumber, komunikasi lintas audiens, interaksi, dan revisi mandiri.',
'Integrated performance|Source-based argument|Audience transfer|Spontaneous defence|Self-editing|Reflective portfolio',
'Kemahiran tinggi terlihat ketika peserta dapat memindahkan kemampuan ke persoalan baru. Portofolio akhir harus berisi karya awal, umpan balik, revisi, dan alasan perubahan. Hafalan jawaban model tidak cukup; penguji perlu mengubah satu kondisi dan melihat apakah argumen serta bahasa ikut menyesuaikan.||Rubrik menilai pemenuhan tugas, akurasi dan nuansa, organisasi, interaksi atau kelancaran, serta penggunaan sumber. Skor kuis tata bahasa hanya salah satu bukti. Pemetaan materi ke C2 adalah sasaran desain, bukan jaminan sertifikasi CEFR. Untuk menyatakan kemahiran individu, diperlukan sampel speaking dan listening autentik, penilaian writing, beberapa tugas baru, dan moderasi penilai.',
[('claim → evidence → limit → implication','The pilot is promising, but its scope limits the recommendation.','Argumen berimbang.'),('revision + reason','I replaced proves with suggests because the study is observational.','Revisi dengan dasar.'),('if the condition changes, …','If funding is halved, I would narrow the pilot.','Transfer ke situasi baru.')],
('I answered six grammar questions, so I am certified C2.','The quiz is one piece of evidence; broader performance assessment is still required.','Label materi tidak otomatis menjadi hasil sertifikasi peserta.'),
'Final fictional brief: A centre is considering a hybrid language programme. A four-week pilot attracted twelve regular attendees from twenty initial registrations. Eight of ten feedback respondents preferred the hybrid format. Two tutors reported additional preparation time, and the budget for next term is not yet confirmed. The board wants a recommendation, a public summary, and a response to the possibility that funding may be reduced by half. There is no comparison group or long-term learning measure.',
'portfolio=portofolio|moderation=penyelarasan penilaian|transfer=penerapan pada situasi baru|defence=pembelaan argumen|attendee=peserta hadir|hybrid=gabungan daring dan tatap muka',
[Q('Tingkat kehadiran rutin dari pendaftar …','60%','80%||120%','12/20 = 60%; denominator pendaftar.','data'),Q('Preferensi hybrid di antara responden …','80% of ten respondents','80% of all twenty registrants||all regular attendees','8/10; jangan ganti denominator.','data'),Q('Batas bukti tentang pembelajaran …','No comparison group or long-term learning measure is supplied.','All long-term outcomes are proven.||The pilot lasted four years.','Brief membatasi inferensi efektivitas.','reading'),Q('Rekomendasi paling proporsional …','Consider a revised pilot once costs and funding are clarified.','Guarantee permanent success immediately.||Ignore tutor workload entirely.','Pertimbangkan bukti, biaya, dan ketidakpastian.','reasoning'),Q('Bukti transfer terbaik …','Adapting the recommendation when the budget changes.','Repeating the model word for word.||Remembering the title alone.','Transfer menguji penerapan pada kondisi baru.','assessment'),S('Lengkapi: The findings are promising, ___ the small sample limits generalisation.','but||yet','Kontras menjaga batas klaim.')],
[T('speaking','Presentasi lima menit dan tanya jawab tiga menit. Setelah presentasi, pasangan mengubah anggaran menjadi separuh. Sesuaikan rekomendasi tanpa mengarang biaya.','I would support a revised pilot, subject to funding and a realistic preparation plan. Twelve of twenty registrants attended regularly, and eight of ten respondents preferred the hybrid format. These are encouraging but limited indicators. If funding is halved, I would first obtain cost estimates and compare a smaller pilot with postponement rather than assume the same design remains feasible.','Angka dan batas benar|Respons spontan terhadap perubahan|Register jelas dan luwes'),T('writing','Tulis briefing 160–200 kata, lalu buat ringkasan publik dan revisi setelah menerima kritik. Model berikut hanya briefing; dua hasil lainnya harus dibuat peserta.','The hybrid programme shows enough promise to justify further investigation, but the available evidence does not support an unconditional permanent launch. Twelve of the twenty initial registrants attended regularly. Eight of ten feedback respondents preferred the hybrid format, although their views cannot automatically be generalised to all registrants. The pilot lasted only four weeks and included neither a comparison group nor a long-term learning measure. In addition, two tutors reported extra preparation time, and next term\'s budget remains uncertain.\n\nI recommend preparing a revised pilot proposal with explicit staffing costs, attendance targets, and learning measures. The board should confirm funding before approving delivery. If the budget is reduced by half, the team should compare the feasibility of a smaller pilot with postponement, rather than assume that the original design can be maintained. A public summary should explain both the encouraging feedback and the limits of the evidence. The final decision should be reviewed after the revised pilot, using consistent measures and feedback from participants who stop attending as well as those who remain.','160–200 kata untuk briefing|Tiga hasil berbeda|Revisi mempertahankan integritas sumber')],'portfolio',('C207',))
]
